      "short": "A woman in a green dress sits at a table surrounded by ornate hats on stands and surfaces, painted in warm tones with visible brushwork.",
      "long": "An oil painting depicts a seated woman with light skin and reddish-brown hair, wearing a long-sleeved olive-green dress. She holds an orange-brimmed hat near her face, appearing to examine it closely. To her left, a tall stand displays a large white ruffled hat with yellow accents. Behind it is a brown hat topped with red fabric. Above her head rests a wide beige hat adorned with green and white floral embellishments. In the foreground, a light blue frilly hat with a dark blue bow lies on the wooden table. The background features vertical strokes of blue and green, while the floor and table are rendered in rich ochre and orange hues. Brushwork is visible throughout, especially in the drapery and textures.",
